          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h2>🚚 Shipping Information</h2><p>We ship Australia-wide with trusted carriers.</p><p>We will attempt to dispatch your goods via Australia Post within 1-2 working days.</p><p><strong>Standard  Delivery:</strong><br/>In normal circumstances please expect delivery within 5-10 Business Days (excluding weekends). For delivery to more remote areas and to WA please allow up to 5 extra days for delivery<br/><strong>Express Delivery:<br/></strong>If you live in a capital city delivery is normally next business day (once packed and sent). Usual Express Delivery times are 3-6 Business Days. Delivery to Western Australia can take up to 5 extra Business Days from New South Wales.  Delivery may take longer if you live in a rural area. Please see Australia Post website for estimated delivery times</p><h2>🏡 Free Local Pickup</h2><p>We offer <strong>free local pickup</strong> for customers in <strong>Woolgoolga, NSW</strong>.</p><p>Local pickup will appear as an option at checkout.<br/><br/>Once your order is ready, you’ll receive an email with <strong>collection details and the pickup address</strong>.</p><p>Please wait for confirmation before arriving.</p><p></p><p><strong>How does Shipping Protection work?</strong></p><p>We pack your order with love and care, but once it leaves us, it’s in the hands of the courier — and sometimes things don’t go to plan.</p><p>To give you peace of mind, we offer <strong>Shipping Protection</strong> at checkout. It’s a quick and easy way to ensure your order is covered if it’s <strong>lost or damaged in transit</strong>. This isn’t insurance — just a simple, stress-free way to get support fast.</p><p>If your parcel arrives damaged, send us a few clear photos of the packaging and items with your order number, and we’ll fast-track a <strong>replacement</strong> or offer <strong>store credit </strong>via our email <strong>contact@thelittlepioneers.com.au</strong></p><p>If your parcel goes missing during transit, we’ll assess the situation promptly and provide a resolution — no need to wait weeks for courier investigations.</p><p>Without Shipping Protection, we’ll still do our best to help, but we’ll need to follow standard courier processes, which can take time.</p><p></p><h2>🔄 Returns & Refunds</h2><p>We offer a 30-day return policy (conditions apply).</p><p>Items must be unused and in original packaging for a refund.</p><p>If your item arrives damaged, please contact us within 48 hours with photos for a replacement.</p><h2>📩 Need help? Email us at : contact@thelittlepioneers.com.au</h2>"
          }
        }
